{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/da41321796349d89d75b0cd103c53dc8.poster.avif?t=1744981718\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/da41321796349d89d75b0cd103c53dc8.webm?t=1744981718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>A fast paced twin-stick roguelite platformer. Climb an ominous clock tower in a series of procedural encounter rooms and past challenging boss fights on your way to reclaiming your lost memory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/90202ea176c72720d58d391013f5859b.poster.avif?t=1744981718\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/90202ea176c72720d58d391013f5859b.webm?t=1744981718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Exchange health for power in fast paced glass cannon gameplay. Find the right balance of attack and defense as you try, die, repeat and progress up the tower<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/805fca8da91de0217de45584419a8d33.poster.avif?t=1744981718\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/805fca8da91de0217de45584419a8d33.webm?t=1744981718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/805fca8da91de0217de45584419a8d33.mp4?t=1744981718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Battle through an almost infinite variety of combat encounters in procedurally generated rooms<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/0ce4929ac7af9b6a121582edf6a2070b.apng?t=1744981718\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/0ce4929ac7af9b6a121582edf6a2070b.poster.avif?t=1744981718\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=114 /></picture></span><br><br>Twin stick shooting, dashing and wall sliding are just the beginning - find power-ups and items on each run and upgrade your arsenal<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/36549b6626a3cb8e940698c95a87b030.poster.avif?t=1744981718\" width=616 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/36549b6626a3cb8e940698c95a87b030.webm?t=1744981718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>An extensive set of options lets you tweak Revita to your playstyle - slow down time, set an outline colour for enemies to make them easier to track or choose the level of aim assist that feels right for you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/0ee2ad66ad3e11e46b7466f8889ae52b.poster.avif?t=1744981718\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/0ee2ad66ad3e11e46b7466f8889ae52b.webm?t=1744981718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Explore an underground subway line infested with monsters and filled with colourful characters who will help you on your journey. Travelling from station to station where elevators take you towards the heights of an ever changing clocktower.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/8a3bba6744f238fc664621d22d19650d.poster.avif?t=1744981718\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/8a3bba6744f238fc664621d22d19650d.webm?t=1744981718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175460/extras/8a3bba6744f238fc664621d22d19650d.mp4?t=1744981718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A nameless child with no memories awakens in the metro with only a vague sense of purpose and desire to reach the distant clocktower, hoping to find answers at the top. On the way they will discover a melancholic world filled with masked characters, monsters and perhaps the answers that the child seeks.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"07ce80bb758e2887d2497454944b84d7d35ba4c3.jpg","localized_name":"Revitalized","name":"Revitalized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1175460/07ce80bb758e2887d2497454944b84d7d35ba4c3.jpg"},{"icon":"da936fb2614946060bb5d4ce86e4fbf0fa2ab15e.jpg","localized_name":"Platformer","name":"Platformer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1175460/da936fb2614946060bb5d4ce86e4fbf0fa2ab15e.jpg"},{"icon":"fdb2cd4905c808f556d316b37ac9aed3c83dca06.jpg","localized_name":"Broken","name":"Broken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1175460/fdb2cd4905c808f556d316b37ac9aed3c83dca06.jpg"},{"icon":"3736431c738335857adb820d65ffbdbe762987b1.jpg","localized_name":"Hear my Prayer","name":"Hear my Prayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1175460/3736431c738335857adb820d65ffbdbe762987b1.jpg"},{"icon":"6